    <profile name="Blade of Judgement" typeId="2857-5ab3-db0f-64a1" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false" id="30e6-a3c5-4ddd-875a">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="e736-f6b3-0474-ddb8">3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="9a62-cd45-d844-0bc3">+3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d">Natural attack rolls of 10 made with this weapon always inflict Critical Hits.
Successful hits made by a model attacking with this weapon can be allocated to models in a target unit by the attacking player, rather than by the target unit’s controlling player (even if models in that unit are already injured). Such attacks can also be allocated to *independent* units in a group, even if there are three or models in its retinue.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
