        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d">Models equipped with this weapon halve their initiative characteristic. Natural attack rolls of 10 made with this weapon always inflict Critical Hits, and Critical Hits made with this weapon triple their damage instead of doubling it.</characteristic>
