            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">This counts as an *artillery* weapon.
When firing this weapon, first select a point on the battlefield within its forward arc, within 15” of this model. This attack hits units within a 3” blast radius of that point.
This weapon can select points on the battlefield that are not visible to the attacking model. When this unit attacks a unit that is not visible to it, it attacks with disadvantage.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
