            <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="a482-225f-a3cb-a700">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">This weapon cannot be used when making a reaction, and cannot target altitude units.
If a model equipped with this weapon makes no actions in the movement phase, successful hits made by a model attacking with this weapon can be allocated to models in a target unit by the attacking player, rather than by the target unit’s controlling player (even if models in that unit are already injured). Such attacks can also be allocated to *independent* units in a group, even if there are three or models in its retinue.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Master of the Hunt" id="rule-master-of-the-hunt" hidden="false">
          <description>This unit cannot be targeted by ranged attacks or affected by any enemy invocations. The first time this unit makes either a charge move action or shoot action, or if an enemy unit ends a move within 6” of this unit, it loses this ability, until any phase ends where this unit is obscured from, or no longer visible to, all enemy units.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
