          <description>During the Strategy Phase, one unit with this ability can make this action.
Select one visible enemy unit to become marked for destruction. Friendly indirect *artillery* attacks made by units within 24” of this unit are not heavily disadvantaged if they are targeting a unit marked for destruction that is within line of sight of this unit.
Only one friendly unit may make this action each turn.</description>
        </rule>
