      <rules>
        <rule name="Haunted By Hunger" id="0cee-f044-5340-0415" hidden="false">
          <description>This unit cannot be affected by any friendly abilities, and a force cannot include more Ymira Shrikes than it does other *Ymirae* units.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Silent Hunter" id="63a9-5600-d79b-50b3" hidden="false">
          <description>This unit has advantage on all of its attacks until the end of the turn if it successfully charges a unit that includes models which cannot see it.
This unit cannot be targeted by ranged attacks or affected by any enemy invocations. The first time this unit makes either a charge move action, or if an enemy unit ends a move within 6” of this unit, it loses the second part of this ability, until any phase ends where this unit is obscured from, or no longer visible to, all enemy units.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
