          <description>When this unit is destroyed, before removing the model, roll a dice. On a 3+, it explodes in a *blast* attack, with a D5” radius originating from its base, with a strength of +3 and a damage of 2, and each unit within the radius gains one attrition point.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
