                    <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="a482-225f-a3cb-a700">2</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">When rolling to determine the Dice characteristic of this weapon, results of 4 or less count as 5.
Units do not benefit from cover when being targeted by this weapon. Each time a unit gains an attrition point as part of an attack that includes this weapon, it gains one additional attrition point. This is not cumulative with other instances of this rule.</characteristic>
