                        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">This weapon makes a *blast* attack targeting a visible point on the battlefield, with a blast radius of 1&quot;. Attacks with this weapon have a damage characteristic of 12 when targeting *structures*.</characteristic>
