    <selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Skysplinter Artillery Gun" hidden="false" id="985a-fd6f-ff34-a274">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Auri" typeId="cost-auri" value="975"/>
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Skysplinter Artillery Gun" typeId="profile-unit" typeName="Unit" hidden="false" id="5de3-52b6-cd3a-2281">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="char-speed">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Health" typeId="char-health">60</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Defence" typeId="char-defence">14 / 14 / 12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Initiative" typeId="char-initiative">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Morale" typeId="char-morale">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Arcane" typeId="char-arcane">-</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Skysplinter Cannon" typeId="f94b-6526-ad27-3051" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="142b-655f-e7fe-cefd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1023-f0db-ffcf-da31">∞</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="1192-2222-5926-5b4b">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="ff5b-347b-c7f0-5770">+6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="a482-225f-a3cb-a700">8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">This is a *destroyer* attack.
Before selecting targets when making attacks with this weapon, its controlling player can choose to either fire it as an artillery attack or as an executioner attack.
*Artillery attacks*: This is an *artillery blast* attack, with a 6” radius originating from a point more than 12” away from the attacking unit. Make two attacks targeting a unit instead of one if the target is a *vehicle*, *construct* or *monster*.
*Executioner attacks*: This weapon has a Dice characteristic of 6 when targeting a *leviathan* unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Armoured Colossus" id="86c3-c067-d001-8a1f" hidden="false">
          <description>Attacks with a damage characteristic of 4 or less that target this unit are made with disadvantage. In addition, this unit always counts as having half the number of attrition points allocated to it when determining the effects of it being *shaken*.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Shell Detonation (D5”)" id="5ecf-c43a-270b-7281" hidden="false">
          <description>When this unit is destroyed, roll a dice. On an 8+, the remaining shells detonate in a *blast* attack, with a D5” radius originating from this unit, with a strength of +3 and a damage of 1.
After resolving this effect, this unit remains on the battlefield as indestructible terrain with the Difficult ability (see Structures and Terrain in the Core Rulebook).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Wargear" id="6388-b8b8-8b5a-af7e" hidden="false">
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Quad-Skaryssan Tracks" hidden="false" id="7a41-5e9a-284c-14f3">
